# The upstream source is fetched inside the image, so the build context is the Dockerfile plus this repo's
# own scripts/ (the GGUF HTTP server that gets copied into the image) -- and nothing else.

**

!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
# The directory itself has to be re-included or the walker never descends into it.
!scripts
!scripts/serve.sh
!scripts/serve_gguf.py
